Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10)
Description: safe reconnaissance and evidence reporting for crypto CTFs
 CCRH inventories challenge files, extracts cryptographic clues, runs bounded
 solver checks, and writes evidence-linked JSON or Markdown reports.
